## 9. What this license does not claim
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

**Not a patent, and not a patent license.** This license is a copyright license and, in section 8, an agreement with
those who take the Materials under it. It is not a patent license and grants none. It does not by itself give the author
an exclusive right to the Method against persons who have not taken the Materials.

**Patent.** Patent applications relating to the Method have been filed with the German Patent and Trade Mark Office
(2026).

**Not claimed (earlier work and third-party work).** The author does not claim, and this license does not restrict:

- Tau Language and everything belonging to IDNI AG (section 2);
- combining values by XOR; commitment schemes; hash chains; digital signatures; event logs and replay; rejection
  sampling; shift-and-XOR mixing steps; pseudo-random generators in general;
- commit-and-reveal protocols as used for after-the-fact verification of a random value;
- describing the rules of a game in a logic; deterministic lockstep simulation; synchronous languages; SAT/SMT solving;
  formal verification in general;
- the rules of any particular game (section 3.4);

each taken individually. Only the Method as defined in section 3 is the subject of section 8.

